  "description": "LINE messaging tools for LLM tool-calling. Exposes the Line.OpenApi.Messaging use case as Microsoft.Extensions.AI AIFunctions (push / multicast / broadcast / reply, plus read-only bot lookups), so an AI agent built on Semantic Kernel or any Microsoft.Extensions.AI host can operate LINE. Sending is opt-in and safe-by-default (read-only unless explicitly enabled), with a send policy and a human-in-the-loop hook.",
